# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This tutorial explores [Qiskit Fermions](/addons/qiskit-fermions) in depth.\n"
"It shows a workflow to construct and transpile application circuits that is easier to use and more future-proof.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tutorial ini meneroka [Qiskit Fermions](/addons/qiskit-fermions) secara mendalam.\n"
"Ia menunjukkan aliran kerja untuk membina dan men-transpile circuit aplikasi yang lebih mudah digunakan dan lebih tahan masa depan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The tutorial follows a flow that is similar to the [Simulate 1D Fermi-Hubbard dynamics with flow sets](/addons/qiskit-fermions/guides/1-d-fermi-hubbard) guide,\n"
"but it extends the approach to spinful systems.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tutorial ini mengikut aliran yang serupa dengan panduan [Simulate 1D Fermi-Hubbard dynamics with flow sets](/addons/qiskit-fermions/guides/1-d-fermi-hubbard),\n"
"tetapi ia memanjangkan pendekatan itu kepada sistem berspin.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learning outcomes {#learning-outcomes}"
msgstr "Hasil pembelajaran {#learning-outcomes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After completing this tutorial, you can expect to understand the following information:\n"
"- How the choice between blocked and interleaved ordering of the spin modes changes which fermionic modes interact, and how that\n"
"  choice appears as Pauli patterns after a flow-set fermion-to-qubit encoding.\n"
"- How to build the time-evolution circuit of the spinful Fermi-Hubbard model as a `FermionicCircuit`, and validate it against `ffsim`.\n"
"- How a flow-set synthesis keeps the two-qubit depth of a Trotter step constant as the chain grows, compared with a term-by-term `LieTrotter` synthesis.\n"
"- How to route such circuits onto the heavy-hex lattice of an IBM&reg; Heron QPU and onto the square lattice of a Nighthawk QPU,\n"
"  including the effect of fractional gates.\n"
"- Why the square lattice of Nighthawk favors blocked ordering with two ancillas while a ladder fits on the QPU, and what it\n"
"  costs to fold the ladder for larger systems.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selepas melengkapkan tutorial ini, anda dijangka memahami maklumat berikut:\n"
"- Bagaimana pilihan antara susunan berblok dan berselang-seli bagi mod spin mengubah mod fermion yang berinteraksi, dan bagaimana\n"
"  pilihan itu muncul sebagai corak Pauli selepas pengekodan fermion-ke-qubit set-aliran.\n"
"- Cara membina circuit evolusi masa model Fermi-Hubbard berspin sebagai `FermionicCircuit`, dan mengesahkannya dengan `ffsim`.\n"
"- Bagaimana sintesis set-aliran mengekalkan kedalaman dua-qubit satu langkah Trotter tetap apabila rantai bertambah panjang, berbanding sintesis `LieTrotter` sebutan demi sebutan.\n"
"- Cara menghalakan circuit sedemikian ke kekisi heavy-hex QPU IBM&reg; Heron dan ke kekisi segi empat sama QPU Nighthawk,\n"
"  termasuk kesan gate pecahan.\n"
"- Mengapa kekisi segi empat sama Nighthawk mengutamakan susunan berblok dengan dua ancilla manakala tangga muat pada QPU, dan apakah\n"
"  kos untuk melipat tangga bagi sistem yang lebih besar.\n"

